Fonts

This software includes the font files below. They are in the assembly, and
`src/GemmaTranslator/Assets/Fonts/OFL.txt` holds their licence.

  Noto Sans, Noto Sans Arabic
  Noto Sans JP, Noto Sans SC, Noto Sans KR
  Copyright the Noto Project Authors (https://github.com/notofonts)
  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1

The SIL Open Font License permits this use. The software does not sell the
fonts, and the reserved font names do not change.

The software supplies these fonts because Raspberry Pi OS Lite can have no
font for Arabic and none for Chinese, Japanese, or Korean. With no font,
Avalonia stops at the start.
